---
name: deep-research-prompt
description: Generate a structured deep research prompt for Claude/Gemini/ChatGPT deep research features
user-invocable: true
argument-hint: [topic] [target-section]
---

Generate a comprehensive deep research prompt for the topic "$0" targeting paper section "$1".

The prompt should:
1. Define the exact scope and boundaries of the research
2. Specify what data to collect (statistics, case studies, benchmarks, dates)
3. List 5-10 seed papers/sources to start from
4. Define the output format (structured markdown with inline citations)
5. Include quality gates: "Every claim must have a source URL or arXiv ID"
6. Specify word count target and depth level
7. List what NOT to include (to avoid overlap with other sections)

Output the prompt in a copyable format ready to paste into a deep research tool.
